        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "As an employee of a mysterious organization, your job is to monitor live surveillance camera footage and report other-worldly anomalies using your sharp eyes and good memory.\n\nMonitor surveillance cameras across six unique levels, each with their own unnerving \"anomalies\"—supernatural occurrences ranging from subtle environmental shifts to grotesque otherworldly intruders. Report anomalies to \"fix\" them and survive the night. If you can.\n\nI'm on Observation Duty is the original viral franchise that ignited a trend in spot-the-difference horror games that are now loved by players worldwide.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
